{"v":4,"catch":"誰將獲得四面格子旗？","desc":"《POLE POSITION II》是NAMCO（Bandai Namco Entertainment）於1983年發行的賽車遊戲。\n比賽分為資格賽和大獎賽。 如果你在排位賽中跑出一圈並取得好成績，你將晉級大獎賽。\n此外，該標題還新增了新課程。\n目標是在四個不同的賽道上獲得杆位！\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2023-12-07","genres":["競速","街機"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/c1a09ced86c6b078ea8163f80072156d4149c215264150e2cd1cb09f263f0085.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/789198553e7971f9d8dabd08c1ce155c4fa37cab011e40b47773f481932e94a7.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/bc5091eb36cfddb90a653ffe0a77fe9fd519957fc0e95b638d65fd3d53989371.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/0a45d3b9a8818865d0a963d2fae148e81f1888dd351a2b55a59e037e5206d160.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/44974737ab8136263f78d2cb7df430e82b196e06c730e21ac9de9b391f9ddb77.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/3244e3594d4aefafd3046be75e5d85118b279c1dd299690e422ab3e191119f06.jpg"],"titleId":"0100b8a01bca6000","dlc":[]}